e argument is $B=(-\\frac{1}{10})(4)=-\\frac{2}{5}.$\n\nIn our case, we have that $B=-\\frac{2}{5}.$ Therefore, the period is $\\frac{2\\pi }{|-\\frac{2}{5}|}=\\frac{2\\pi }{\\frac{2}{5}}=5\\pi .$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186532864 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "141f5551-934e-5440-8953-1b3d3cf88e6c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,i+12 e^{4 t}\\,j- 9 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532866} {:answer/id #uuid "44aab5b3-a627-5319-b75d-247ebb8b0162" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(6 - 9 t^{2})\\,i+(12 e^{4 t} - \\frac{3}{\\left(t + 2\\right)^{2}})\\,j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532874} {:answer/id #uuid "5e6b1f0d-8766-51a0-9b69-2576acc19597" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3 t^{3} + 6 t + 3)\\,i+\\frac{3 \\left(\\left(t + 2\\right) e^{4 t} - 1\\right)}{t + 2}\\,j+6 \\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532879} {:answer/id #uuid "bb2d1687-1eb8-5477-9fad-53c4f1a5c47a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(9 t^{2} + 6)\\,i+(12 e^{4 t} + \\frac{3}{\\left(t + 2\\right)^{2}})\\,j- 18 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532897} {:answer/id #uuid "fa448647-c439-5d87-9345-4f25b8d6061c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9 t^{2}\\,i+\\frac{3}{\\left(t + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 9 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532909}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bb2d1687-1eb8-5477-9fad-53c4f1a5c47a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(9 t^{2} + 6)\\,i+(12 e^{4 t} + \\frac{3}{\\left(t + 2\\right)^{2}})\\,j- 18 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532897} :answer-field/id #uuid "6b16c366-2ff9-5f7d-bf99-55f090fe22ad" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532881}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "0ea031d4-a7c9-52a4-913c-d764f5dca240" :question/problem "Find the derivative of $3f(t)+3g(t)$ with respect to $t$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t)&=(t^{3} + 2)\\,i- \\frac{1}{t + 2}\\,j+\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k \\\\ g(t)&=(2 t - 1)\\,i+e^{4 t}\\,j+\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the constant multiple rule and the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(3f(t)+3g(t))'=3f'(\\!t)+3g'(\\!t).\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t^{3} + 2),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(- \\frac{1}{t + 2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)})⟩ \\\\ &=3 t^{2}\\,i+\\frac{1}{\\left(t + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k \\\\ g'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2 t - 1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(e^{4 t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)})⟩ \\\\ &=2\\,i+4 e^{4 t}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(3f(t)+3g(t))'&=3f'(\\!t)+3g'(\\!t) \\\\ &=3\\left(3 t^{2}\\,i+\\frac{1}{\\left(t + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right)+3\\left(2\\,i+4 e^{4 t}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right) \\\\ &=\\left(9 t^{2}\\,i+\\frac{3}{\\left(t + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 9 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right)+\\left(6\\,i+12 e^{4 t}\\,j- 9 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right) \\\\ &=(9 t^{2} + 6)\\,i+(12 e^{4 t} + \\frac{3}{\\left(t + 2\\right)^{2}})\\,j- 18 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186532870 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19e97975-4c74-5507-b653-606d0d1bf2e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\,i+8 e^{4 t}\\,j- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532868} {:answer/id #uuid "66c548d2-02d8-5526-b8e1-1c99ae671173" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2 - 16 t)\\,i+(8 e^{4 t} - \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}})\\,j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532880} {:answer/id #uuid "86ed3a70-cdde-56de-b810-9899566e914d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 16 t\\,i- \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j+6 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532887} {:answer/id #uuid "eed0e2f3-ee96-5a6d-a583-fb4c12616f63" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(- 8 t^{2} + 2 t - 10)\\,i+\\frac{2 \\left(\\left(t - 3\\right) e^{4 t} + 4\\right)}{t - 3}\\,j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532906} {:answer/id #uuid "ef7037f7-a559-5d3e-be45-91f41c699e27" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(16 t + 2)\\,i+(8 e^{4 t} + \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}})\\,j- 12 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532907}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "66c548d2-02d8-5526-b8e1-1c99ae671173" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2 - 16 t)\\,i+(8 e^{4 t} - \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}})\\,j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532880} :answer-field/id #uuid "468a0c5a-ad2b-5b7f-abac-b961a5396963" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532875}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "20b4dae3-6b9d-5ae1-bd0a-7100a3030dee" :question/problem "Find the derivative of $-2f(t)+2g(t)$ with respect to $t$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t)&=(4 t^{2} + 1)\\,i- \\frac{4}{t - 3}\\,j+\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k \\\\ g(t)&=(t - 4)\\,i+e^{4 t}\\,j+\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the constant multiple rule and the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(-2f(t)+2g(t))'=-2f'(\\!t)+2g'(\\!t).\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4 t^{2} + 1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(- \\frac{4}{t - 3}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)})⟩ \\\\ &=8 t\\,i+\\frac{4}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k \\\\ g'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t - 4),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(e^{4 t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)})⟩ \\\\ &=1\\,i+4 e^{4 t}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-2f(t)+2g(t))'&=-2f'(\\!t)+2g'(\\!t) \\\\ &=-2\\left(8 t\\,i+\\frac{4}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right)+2\\left(1\\,i+4 e^{4 t}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right) \\\\ &=\\left(- 16 t\\,i- \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j+6 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right)+\\left(2\\,i+8 e^{4 t}\\,j- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right) \\\\ &=(2 - 16 t)\\,i+(8 e^{4 t} - \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}})\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186532882 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2592c444-2abd-56c3-9730-56a494189a52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 t^{2}\\,i+\\frac{4}{\\left(t - 1\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 8 \\sin{\\left(4 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532872} {:answer/id #uuid "a9f57fdd-7ab8-5ee9-bfdd-4e1c04109c84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(12 t^{2} + 8)\\,i+(8 e^{4 t} + \\frac{4}{\\left(t - 1\\right)^{2}})\\,j- 16 \\sin{\\left(4 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532893} {:answer/id #uuid "